WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Hi there, this is Steve, co-founder of LingQ. Someone who is enjoying learning languages.

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:10.950
I learned about nine of them
up to the age of sixty and I've learned

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:17.300
another nine in the last ten or so years.
And I know very well that in language learning

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:21.420
first of all, everyone can do it,
everyone can do it, it doesn't take a

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:25.650
special talent, although you get better
the more languages you learn. And it

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:32.399
consists of three absolutely important
keys. The first one is your attitude.

00:00:32.399 --> 00:00:36.400
Are you interested? Do you like the
language? Do you like learning it?

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:40.300
Do you believe in the system? Do you think you're gonna get there? You have to be positive.

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:45.000
That's the first. The second of
all, you have to spend the time, find the time, listen.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.160
Ten minutes here, Fifteen minutes there.

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:52.710
You have to find the time and work
on your LingQs. And the third thing is

00:00:52.710 --> 00:00:57.120
developing the ability to notice what's
happening in the language, but that comes.

00:00:57.120 --> 00:01:01.540
If you have the attitude, if you spend
the time, you will start to notice the language

00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:04.000
and you are going to learn.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:06.000
Take it from me.

